"""Work Package I: VELOOP KPI catalogue.

Every KPI is a DEFINITION, not a target and not a measured VELOOP result. No target values are
set anywhere (Task 01 section 15). All statuses are 'Proposed definition' until VELOOP approves
them and the required fields are verified in production.

Shared definitions used below:
  Qualifying activity event: any event flagged qualifying_activity = True in deliverable 08
    (user-initiated earning, engagement or money actions; passive views and logins excluded).
  Reporting day: IST calendar day (Asia/Kolkata), matching the official daily claim window.
  Production filter: data_environment = 'production' on every KPI.
"""

